{"ts":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"## Outcome\nA coding agent that has never seen this workspace can enumerate and operate the entire pm capability set from a single screen of help output, and every historical spelling keeps working.\n\n## Why this is a milestone, not an epic\npm-n7rr is the living execution epic (partition of consolidation tasks). This milestone is the outcome gate: it declares when the grammar work is done enough to freeze, which is the precondition the GA stability contract (pm-agou) consumes.\n\n## Delivery chain\npm-pbyu (ADR, accept first) -> pm-0z7n (alias shim foundation) -> the consolidation partition under pm-n7rr (pfqi/kcs4/tqel/yql1/tnud/6apl/xkgq/ik19/eq4x/o3fh/npr3/lp4j/szdc) -> pm-e2bq tiered help -> pm-8pnj transcript replay proves the outcome.\n\n## Explicit non-goals\nNo capability removal. No breaking rename without an alias. No grammar freeze here — freezing is pm-agou's job."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-j82fd3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Outcome milestone: agent-legible command grammar — one-screen surface, zero feature loss, alias-preserved"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Milestone"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","grammar","horizon:near","milestone","outcome","token-efficiency"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":4800},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"Top-level command count meets the pm-pbyu ADR target with zero capability removed; Every pre-consolidation spelling resolves via the alias shim with a one-line migration hint; Golden agent-transcript replay shows a measured tokens-per-completed-task reduction versus the pre-consolidation baseline; Tiered help renders the full core surface in one screen; pm help --all remains complete"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/goal","value":"agent-legible-surface"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/objective","value":"A coding agent operates every pm capability from one screen of help without out-of-band context"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/value","value":"Cuts the dominant agent onboarding cost: today's ~70 top-level commands force out-of-band documentation reads before the first useful call."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/impact","value":"Every agent invocation in every downstream workspace gets cheaper; the grammar freeze in the GA contract depends on this landing first."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/outcome","value":"Top-level noun count at or below the ADR target, every retired spelling still functional as a hidden alias, and a measured drop in tokens-per-completed-task."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/why_now","value":"The surface is still growing (graph, plan, merge, history-* families all landed post-v0.1). Consolidating later means freezing more aliases forever."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-doxj"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-0z7n","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-1kxs","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-8pnj","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-e2bq","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-m08hza","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-mpbb","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-n7rr","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"},{"id":"pm-pbyu","kind":"blocked_by","created_at":"2026-07-24T23:42:39.540Z"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"320c82f048d1a0b31d192afb1a5cac47f562ab4aed9e0bd01768b7246831e18e","message":"File outcome milestone for the CLI grammar horizon"}
